1
00:00:00,893 --> 00:00:02,393
(Leonard:)Okay, let's try it this way.

2
00:00:02,562 --> 00:00:05,812
What if this People magazine thing
is the best Raj is going to achieve?

3
00:00:07,567 --> 00:00:10,527
- I had not considered that.
- Mm-hm. Come on.

4
00:00:10,903 --> 00:00:13,653
(Sheldon:)I often forget
other people have limitations.

5
00:00:13,823 --> 00:00:15,863
(Sheldon:)It's so sad.

6
00:00:16,367 --> 00:00:18,957
- He can feel sadness?
- Not really.

7
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,160
It's what you and I call condescension.

8
00:00:22,957 --> 00:00:26,087
Now, when we go in there,
let's show Raj that we're happy for him.

9
00:00:26,252 --> 00:00:27,962
(Sheldon:)But I'm not.

10
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:31,420
(Howard:)Well, then fake it. Look at me.

11
00:00:31,591 --> 00:00:35,221
(Howard:)I could be grinding on the fact that
without my stabilizing telescope mount...

12
00:00:35,386 --> 00:00:39,476
(Howard:)...he never would have found
that stupid little clump of cosmic schmutz.

13
00:00:41,309 --> 00:00:43,139
(Howard:)But I'm bigger than that.

14
00:00:43,603 --> 00:00:45,313
(Sheldon:)Fine. What do you want me to do?

15
00:00:45,938 --> 00:00:47,188
(Leonard:)Smile.

16
00:00:54,822 --> 00:01:00,022
(Howard:)Oh, crap, that's terrifying.

